      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Trying to compare different services with lots of helpful providers was quite difficult.  Zohair stood out because although his quote was among the lowest, his service was local, patient and well-organised.  He was able to talk me through all aspects of the install, change system details multiple times, and give very good followup service as well. His installers were top level and he sells all the solid-quality brands.   When the install happens it is very quick, so it is good to have the plan well thought through before-hand, e.g. positioning of inverter and the like.  There may not be time to make changes on the day.  Our install is producing very nicely now, even on cloudy days.  We next hope to ask Inspire for additional panels on our deck roof, and also a battery.  (We have 25 Jinko panels for 11kW with a 15kW Sungrow 3 phase inverter, slightly over-sized to allow for future panels.)",
